+each F_ij, locates its unique longest occupied run, and checks translation
+consistency.  selftest reports its O(k^2 p) operation count and wall time as
+reference_algorithm, outside the failing attacks.  The compact route notices
+that the run start is one plus the hidden endpoint difference and reads only
+the star pairs F_0j.  That is a short change of variables after it is seen, but
+mechanically scanning every displayed set is not realistic without tools.
